<header><p class="section-kicker">Bloogsite policies</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Last updated: November 1, 2026</p></header>
<section><h2>Information collected automatically</h2><p>Bloogsite and its hosting providers may process basic technical information such as IP address, browser type, device type, requested pages, and security events to deliver and protect the website.</p></section>
<section><h2>Analytics</h2><p>Bloogsite may use privacy-conscious website analytics to understand general traffic patterns and improve the site. If analytics requiring consent are enabled, the appropriate notice and controls will be provided.</p></section>
<section><h2>External services</h2><p>Links to social networks and other websites take you to services operated by third parties. Their privacy practices and terms apply when you use those services.</p></section>
<section><h2>Information you share</h2><p>Do not send passwords, payment details, health records, or other sensitive information through Bloogsite’s public social channels.</p></section>
<section><h2>Questions</h2><p>For privacy questions, use the channels listed on the <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.</p></section>
